    },
    {
      "$id": 2,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "So the Telethia has made its move[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 3,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 4,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Yes.[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 5,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 6,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "That one[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 7,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Is it planning to contact the Monado[XENO:line ]?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 8,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 9,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "How are the Faces coming along?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 10,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 11,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Repairs to the Black one are complete."
    },
    {
      "$id": 12,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 13,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "What about 《Nemesis》?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 14,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 15,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Well[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 16,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 17,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "I hear the Homs with the Monado"
    },
    {
      "$id": 18,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 19,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "has reached Eryth Sea?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 20,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Yes.[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 21,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 22,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Then there's only one place he's headed."
    },
    {
      "$id": 23,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 24,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Even so,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 25,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "I doubt that one will release it.[XENO:line ]"
    },
    {
      "$id": 26,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 27,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Either way,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 28,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "however small the threat,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 29,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "it's best to nip it in the bud."
    },
    {
      "$id": 30,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 31,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "There's something I want to test, too."
    },
    {
      "$id": 32,
      "style": 124,
      "name": ""
    },
    {
      "$id": 33,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "Now,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 34,
      "style": 124,
      "name": "begin the invasion of the Giant God Realm."
